#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "A free IBM course on building a foundational understanding of quantum computing, technology, and applications for business."
msgid "Builds foundations of quantum computing, technology, and business applications."
msgstr "Isang libreng kurso ng IBM tungkol sa pagbuo ng pundasyon ng pag-unawa sa quantum computing, teknolohiya, at mga aplikasyon para sa negosyo."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-tanaw"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-tanaw {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Designed by IBM Quantum&reg; experts, this course covers the essentials of quantum computing and applications for business. Learn about this new computing paradigm, how it works, and its potential to address incredibly complex business problems. Complete the course to earn your IBM Quantum Business Foundations badge.\n"
msgstr "Dinisenyo ng mga eksperto ng IBM Quantum&reg;, sinasaklaw ng kursong ito ang mga pangunahing kaalaman sa quantum computing at mga aplikasyon para sa negosyo. Alamin ang tungkol sa bagong paradigma ng computing na ito, kung paano ito gumagana, at ang potensyal nitong tugunan ang mga napakakumplikadong problema sa negosyo. Kumpletuhin ang kurso para makuha ang iyong IBM Quantum Business Foundations badge.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Pagsusulit {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for Quantum business foundations, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training linked below. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. Once you have passed the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Para makuha ang iyong badge para sa Quantum business foundations, kumuha ng pagsusulit sa IBM&reg; Training na naka-link sa ibaba. Ang pagsusulit na ito ay nilayong gawin pagkatapos basahin ang mga aralin sa kursong ito. Kapag naipasa mo na ang pagsusulit, aabisuhan ka ng Credly na nakakuha ka na ng badge.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Pagsusulit](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Awarded Badge {#awarded-badge}"
msgstr "Badge na Iginawad {#awarded-badge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Image of the awarded badge\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![\"Image of the awarded badge\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/badge.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credly {#credly}"
msgstr "Credly {#credly}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/). IBM employees can view the IBM Internal Privacy Statement [here](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice).\n"
msgstr "PAUNAWA: Ginagamit ng IBM ang mga serbisyo ng Credly, isang third-party na processor ng data na pinahintulutan ng IBM at matatagpuan sa United States, upang tumulong sa pamamahala ng IBM Digital Badge program. Para maibigay sa iyo ang IBM Digital Badge, ang iyong personal na impormasyon (pangalan, email address, at badge na nakuha) ay ibabahagi sa Credly. Makakatanggap ka ng email notification mula sa Credly na may mga tagubilin para sa pag-claim ng badge. Ginagamit ang iyong personal na impormasyon para maibigay ang iyong badge at para sa pag-uulat ng programa at mga layuning operasyonal. Maaaring ibahagi ng IBM ang personal na impormasyong nakolekta sa mga subsidiary ng IBM at sa mga third party sa buong mundo. Pangangasiwaan ito ayon sa mga kagawian ng IBM sa privacy. Maaaring tingnan ang IBM Privacy Statement [dito.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/) Matitingnan ng mga empleyado ng IBM ang IBM Internal Privacy Statement [dito.](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice)\n"
